ncepts and helps readers make informed decisions.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/\",\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/durjey-kayath-513b34199\/\"],\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/author\/durjey-kayath\/\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001234113\",\"position\":1,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001234113\",\"name\":\"1. What are social media KPIs?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Social media KPIs\u00a0(Key Performance Indicators) are specific measurable values that show whether your social media activities are meeting your business\u00a0objectives. They go beyond simple metrics to track progress toward defined goals.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001244111\",\"position\":2,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001244111\",\"name\":\"2. What are the most important social media KPIs?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The most\u00a0important social media KPIs\u00a0depend on your goals. For brand awareness, reach and impressions matter most. For engagement, focus on engagement\u00a0rate\u00a0and shares. For revenue, track ROAS, CPA, and conversion rate.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001256098\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001256098\",\"name\":\"3. How do I measure social media KPIs?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can use platform-native tools (Instagram Insights, LinkedIn Analytics, Facebook Business Suite) combined with web analytics tools like Google Analytics 4 to\u00a0track social media KPIs. For more advanced tracking, tools like Sprout Social, Hootsuite, or HubSpot offer centralized dashboards.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001268285\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001268285\",\"name\":\"4. What are some common social media KPIs for paid campaigns?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Common\u00a0paid social media KPIs\u00a0include cost per click (CPC), cost per conversion, ROAS, CTR, and customer acquisition cost (CAC). These help you understand the efficiency and profitability of your paid social media spend.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001288993\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001288993\",\"name\":\"5. How many social media KPIs should I track?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most experts recommend tracking three to five\u00a0social media key performance indicators\u00a0per campaign or goal. Tracking too many at once makes it hard to focus. Choose the ones that most directly reflect your current\u00a0objective.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001301335\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-kpis\/#faq-question-1783001301335\",\"name\":\"6. What is the difference between KPIs and metrics in social media?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Metrics are all the measurable data points available to you.\u00a0KPIs 